  "description": "Skaters line up in the corner. One at a time, skate a skill all the way around the first face-off circle, then drop down and go all the way around the second circle the other way, so both sides get the same work. Change the skill each time through: crossunders, C-cuts, quick-feet hi-lo, heel-to-heel pushes, and an inside pivot with one crossover. Get the footwork right before adding speed.",
